  "fullVisibleText": "Back to tasks\nAdd task\nSettings & data\nAppearance & language\nBackups & transfer\nReminders & installation\nTask maintenance\nHelp & about\nBackups & transfer\nTasks changed since the last export · exported today. Export again\nTask backup\n\nDownload a restorable backup of all tasks, including archived tasks. Saved views, preferences and recovery history are not included.\n\nDownload backup\nRestore from a backup\n\nChoose a JSON task backup. Preview it before deciding to merge or replace.\n\nChoose backup file\nLocal recovery history\n\nReview recovery points in this browser, then export or restore the selected tasks.\n\nRecovery history\nOther data tools\nSpreadsheet export\n\nDownload a CSV report of all tasks, including archived tasks. Reports cannot restore tasks.\n\nExport all tasks as CSV\nTransfer saved views\n\nExport or import saved searches, filters and layouts in a separate file. Your tasks stay unchanged.\n\nTransfer saved views\nBrowser storage protection\n\nReview storage usage, persistent storage and the protection your browser can provide.\n\nReview storage status\nTransfer saved views\n×\n\nSaved views: 1\n\nMove saved searches, filters and layouts with a separate JSON file. Task data uses Export/Backup; app preferences stay on this device.\n\nView files may contain private search terms, project names and tags. Review them before sharing.\n\nExport views JSON\nImport views JSON\nClose\nList updated, 1 task in the current scope",
  "dialog": "Transfer saved views\n×\n\nSaved views: 1\n\nMove saved searches, filters and layouts with a separate JSON file. Task data uses Export/Backup; app preferences stay on this device.\n\nView files may contain private search terms, project names and tags. Review them before sharing.\n\nExport views JSON\nImport views JSON\nClose",
